WEBVTT

00:01:56.796 --> 00:02:00.676
Some of the measures were controversial
when first introduced,

00:02:00.716 --> 00:02:05.636
but now a majority
of the population thinks --

00:02:05.636 --> 00:02:09.636
even those who are not
that concerned about climate change --

00:02:09.676 --> 00:02:12.516
think that we are creating a better city.

00:02:13.996 --> 00:02:15.156
For too long,

00:02:15.196 --> 00:02:19.556
discussions about climate change
have been about sacrifice.

00:02:20.076 --> 00:02:21.796
I am here to tell you

00:02:21.796 --> 00:02:26.116
that climate solutions
actually make a better city

00:02:26.156 --> 00:02:28.796
and a better quality of life for everyone.

00:02:29.396 --> 00:02:32.876
This is only the first
of five lessons we have learned